  "premise": "A block curator needs one glowing marble to illuminate a series of exhibits, but the last room is unreachable by the original track. Each arriving marble activates a turntable that aligns the next track segment, and the final turntable routes it back through the ceiling as the museum’s glowing exit sign.",
